# ASMENU_en.dat - By TyRaS-SW - English strings for msc_overlay.lua
# Exact match (case-insensitive fallback)
#
# Structure:
#   1. General UI
#   2. Volume / Audio (base labels)
#   3. Headers
#   4. Section descriptions (DESC_*)
#   5. Per-tab descriptions (DESC_<SECTION>_<TAB>)
#   6. Keyboard / Mouse hints

