# --- 3. Headers ------------------------------------------------------------
SCREENSHOT_HEADER=TAKE SCREENSHOT
RECORD_HEADER=RECORD VIDEO

# --- 4. Section descriptions ----------------------------------------------
DESC_SHADERS=SHADERS|Improve the image with upscaling, sharpening, retro CRT effects and more.
DESC_SHAPES=SHAPES|Change the screen geometry with curvature, keystone or rounded corners.
DESC_CROPS=CROPS|Crop the image to match the exact resolution of your choice, like to NSO and others.
DESC_BEZELS=BEZELS|Overlay decorative borders for a more authentic look.
DESC_WINDOW=WINDOW|Resize, reposition, rotate, or keep the window always on top.
DESC_CAPTURE=CAPTURE|Take screenshots or record video clips of your gameplay.
DESC_VIDEO_OPTIONS=VIDEO OPTIONS|Adjust color, aspect ratio, deinterlacing and motion settings.
DESC_AUDIO=AUDIO|Control the volume, mute, and Audio Boost up to 400%.
DESC_HELP=HELP|Check for updates, open the website or join the Discord community.
DESC_TOOLS=TOOLS|Launch MPV-SW-Capture TOOLS, INSTALLER or SETUP directly from here.

# --- 5. Per-tab descriptions ----------------------------------------------
DESC_WINDOW_SIZE=SIZE|Choose the window scale from 0.5x to 2.0x, or go fullscreen.
DESC_WINDOW_POSITION=POSITION|Move the window to one of nine predefined screen positions.
DESC_WINDOW_ROTATION=ROTATION|Rotate the image 90 degrees or enable Mirror Mode.
DESC_WINDOW_OTHER_OPTIONS=OTHER OPTIONS|Toggle the window border, the title bar, or remove both at once.
DESC_WINDOW_WINDOW_EXTRAS=WINDOW EXTRAS|Keep the window always on top or stretch the aspect ratio.
DESC_AUDIO_ALL=ALL|Quick volume actions: +10%, -10%, mute, or set to 100% / 50%.
DESC_AUDIO_AUDIO_BOOST=AUDIO BOOST|Amplify capture audio above 100% (up to 400%) for low-volume content.
DESC_AUDIO_AUDIO_OUTPUT_MODE=OUTPUT MODE|Choose which audio backend handles the capture stream.

# --- 6. Keyboard / Mouse hints --------------------------------------------
KEYBOARD: [ARROW KEYS] Move. [ENTER] Apply. [TAB] Change to next section. [ESC] Close menu.=KEYBOARD: [ARROW KEYS] Move. [ENTER] Apply. [TAB] Change to next section. [ESC] Close menu.
MOUSE: Click any section to choose an option.=MOUSE: Click any section to choose an option.